            {
                "entry_id": "21ff3e8c-aeba-33d7-8ca1-c1a9b9b05219",
                "word": "selah",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cb5ceb13-b9b2-4561-b2de-4bab769a382d",
                        "entry_id": "21ff3e8c-aeba-33d7-8ca1-c1a9b9b05219",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "selahs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a3f03d30-0392-3c86-ba5d-a549b0cdebba",
                        "entry_id": "21ff3e8c-aeba-33d7-8ca1-c1a9b9b05219",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pause or rest of a contemplative nature."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e4fe4c2d-589b-49f8-91d9-3f9e8d6bf2ce",
                                "sense_id": "a3f03d30-0392-3c86-ba5d-a549b0cdebba",
                                "text": "At times, we too, need to experience a \"Selah\" in our lives, a time when we pause and rest. To be still and rest is good therapy for today's fast pace of living. The heart strings may be taut, even on the verge of snapping. Suddenly, God inserts a \"Selah,\" a rest, that we might pause and calmly think of Him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "42817f67-e47d-40df-9ebc-1859487ac6d6",
                                "sense_id": "a3f03d30-0392-3c86-ba5d-a549b0cdebba",
                                "text": "Unless the musicians themselves develop a prophetic lifestyle, the selah will be only an irritating piece of ritual. But if the musicians have an ear to hear, a selah will be a highly creative interlude that opens the door for the Holy Spirit to take the church into a higher level of inspiration."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee2d1d5e-8f9f-4267-b201-7288e20645b7",
                                "sense_id": "a3f03d30-0392-3c86-ba5d-a549b0cdebba",
                                "text": "Your crossroads moment is often a transition time, or Selah, for him as well. Two Selahs happening at once can create added stress."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6bd635c3-919a-4068-805a-06ea708a047a",
                                "sense_id": "a3f03d30-0392-3c86-ba5d-a549b0cdebba",
                                "text": "Maybe this is a good time for a Selah. Lol. It is for me. Selah means “pause, and think about that” or a more literal definition, “God had spoken.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
